{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Vengeance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulslike Sci-fi Action RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's a short samurai story about <strong>MasterBun</strong>, a warrior with honor and a mysterious past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the &quot;<strong>Shattered land of Time&quot; on Planet Earth</strong>, a realm where <strong>death has been severed from the cycle of life</strong>.  The sky is fractured, as if a celestial mirror was broken across the heavens, and light filters through in strange, haunting ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must Travel the world to Restore Peace from all form of Invaders.\u00a0You are not chosen\u2014you are created. Forged for one purpose: to travel the lands and <strong>reignite the peace that once was</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to explore 6 worlds to restore peace. There is\u00a0 over 40 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2289050?t=1755607628","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289050/05201bccd2b9f52fd2e8d515a8c1369e9df81d7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755607628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289050/11ef5ecb61ce902788f4775c5ed6e48be8041eb3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755607628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289050/11ef5ecb61ce902788f4775c5ed6e48be8041eb3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755607628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Vengeance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulslike Sci-fi Action RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's a short samurai story about <strong>MasterBun</strong>, a warrior with honor and a myste